A basic modeling tool
======================

The end goal of this project is to create a simple modeling tool Based off of SysML

It is aptly called simple-SysML

This tool is a work in progress right now it supports BDDS(Block definitional diagrams) and state machines


user guide
======================
click a button and drag to create a block in the tool

press ctrl+click will create a temp line that when in contact with onter block will form connection




Selecting a block will allow you to edit it's name double clicking on it will allow you to enter state machine mode


